# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1016
# Description: Adversaries may look for details about the network configuration and settings of systems they access or through information discovery of remote systems
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*netsh* AND process.command_line:*show * AND process.command_line:*firewall *) AND (process.command_line:*config * OR process.command_line:*state * OR process.command_line:*rule * OR process.command_line:*name=all*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\netsh.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"netsh.exe")))
